{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6001_p", "source_sha256": "81ea12c892b3ae3ad84448f4bf7f0aa04cb35c2820acd93b5d564ac296682c3e", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は順調だ。\nだが、歌織さんは浮かない顔をしているな……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄进行得很顺利。\n不过，歌织看起来一脸闷闷不乐啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6002_052kao", "source_sha256": "c8da3cfd0710b47f67b34b9397d32811aa4a29a5198da0cf1d5739d6aa4b10bc", "ja": "うーん、どうすればいいのかしら……？", "zh": "嗯……该怎么办才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6003_p", "source_sha256": "66a2c6521231f5a4fea30ddb836387b7b8f349d0c2a6422d7c1aeacb264d9376", "ja": "歌織さん、どうかしたんですか？\n何だか難しい顔をしてますが……。", "zh": "歌织，你怎么了？\n看起来一副很苦恼的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6004_052kao", "source_sha256": "d8f499e4e0e40faa0b67a32d1b606a61548a72591a409d36dcc9d4839271a75e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。ええ……先ほど、\nカメラマンさんからリクエストをいただいたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。嗯……刚才摄影师先生提出了一个要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6005_052kao", "source_sha256": "7fbff45f34a7e3a30d2e58b15b97f0a457f14eec2d11320625e568ddc305df82", "ja": "後半の撮影はテーマを変えて、\n相手を翻弄するような表情をしてほしいと……。", "zh": "后半部分的拍摄要换个主题，\n希望我能做出一种把对方玩弄于股掌之间的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6006_p", "source_sha256": "eee573b925088ff9b68be359c548d86be8d8398ec2f432747dba4406d67415d2", "ja": "なるほど……。\n確かに、難しいリクエストですね。", "zh": "原来如此……  \n确实是个很难的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6007_052kao", "source_sha256": "876b763bfa072c927a3d29ce2ce0fb2bba46feb840c707a7bb87b7ddc4c1bd1f", "ja": "はい。私、相手を翻弄する表情というのが、\nわからなくて……。どんな顔をしたらいいんでしょう？", "zh": "是的。我不太明白该做出什么样的表情，才能让对方心神不宁……到底该摆出什么表情才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6008_052kao", "source_sha256": "3aca2fd4e2b02ee4d25c8365b0f2ff56070cb271827d6b940238511e25de3bfe", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\nよければ、アドバイスをいただけませんか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n可以的话，能给我一些建议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6009", "source_sha256": "9df486dd8be8881cabbb76d0f310e2600aa2c5c6d5ce346fdd69e079e5ad8c71", "ja": "甘えた表情", "zh": "撒娇的表情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6010", "source_sha256": "b560272d6f7cfd6b8b0b5e7d06359b3e26198b61bfdd672c447b4d2c696510e1", "ja": "セクシーな表情", "zh": "性感的表情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6011", "source_sha256": "c4875ef3e95b06252f49897672bd496186faf6071d9c5b889ad59a8b09ed4792", "ja": "冷たい表情", "zh": "冷漠的表情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6100_p", "source_sha256": "ffcb4b92bc675287a2c2a000adf71947bc2669c79bbd5b78e5237da704c53b6d", "ja": "それなら、甘えるような表情はどうですか？\n写真をみる人もドキッとして、翻弄されるかと。", "zh": "那样的话，试试露出撒娇般的表情怎么样？\n看照片的人也会心头一跳，说不定会被你迷得神魂颠倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6101_052kao", "source_sha256": "7493bb231297d97e8d920dc43cb13add53c1f873dff3ab28f1c747bf7f42b831", "ja": "なるほど。それはいいかもしれませんね！\nじゃあ、ちょっと上目遣いで見つめてみるとか……？", "zh": "原来如此。那或许不错呢！\n那就试着稍微抬眼注视……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6102_052kao", "source_sha256": "96a7f4a3ca199b0655a13b40e64386e4b7b29191141596a4fb322b981b4e50fd", "ja": "「{$P$}さん、お願い……。\n私に力を貸してほしい……な？」", "zh": "“{$P$}先生，拜托了……\n能借给我力量……吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6103_052kao", "source_sha256": "df97432c527a585f97a03b601eb051e4f826eb74dbea2f757538e0e4adea509a", "ja": "こんな感じですか？　{$P$}さんが\nドキっとしたなら、成功ですね。うふふ♪", "zh": "是这种感觉吗？如果让{$P$}先生心跳加速了，那就成功了呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6200_p", "source_sha256": "07fbaaa36f309f2bda01eb25fab1676f98243b573529b695e846b455d704698e", "ja": "セクシーな表情に挑戦してみるのはどうですか？\n大人の魅力を活かすんです！", "zh": "要不要试试看摆出性感的表情？\n发挥成年人的魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6201_052kao", "source_sha256": "7d7a6185b1a2799eaa522acabcae55e5b5aab7fc75573f8d4546148ed74b47ac", "ja": "せ、セクシーですか？　それなら……莉緒ちゃんや\n風花ちゃんのグラビアを参考にしてみようかしら？", "zh": "色、性感吗？那样的话……我来参考一下莉绪和风花的写真吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6202_052kao", "source_sha256": "3ebdbe094ba5006089d0a5890a1cf9c8f914360ca1a2d3efc80947bc07339393", "ja": "ちょっと恥ずかしいですし、ふたりみたいにできるか\nわかりませんけど……。精一杯、頑張ってみますね♪", "zh": "虽然有点害羞，也不知道能不能做到像她们两位那样……但我会竭尽全力试试看的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6300_p", "source_sha256": "ccf6c4d8928c84c67e39590e07c4a45fab9a07c19272c7db36d1703cde904be2", "ja": "あえて、冷たい表情をしてみるのはどうでしょう？\n冷たくされた方が、逆にドキッとすることもあるかと。", "zh": "不如故意摆出冷淡的表情试试看？\n被冷淡对待，反而有时会让人心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6301_052kao", "source_sha256": "ed54d9f9f244b8142fa820795954acb31b82de511ed5e611b325502dfec8427a", "ja": "冷たい表情がいいんですか……？\n{$P$}さんが、そう言うなら……。", "zh": "冷淡的表情比较好吗……？\n既然{$P$}先生这么说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6302_052kao", "source_sha256": "c91140eb62da1655b08055732f21c1aa775f75d6c5f0667c20f2aa204a82da27", "ja": "「ねえ、これで真剣に考えたつもり？\n参考にならないわ！」……えっと、こんな感じですか？", "zh": "“我说，你以为这样就算认真考虑过了吗？\n根本派不上用场！”……那个，是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6303_p", "source_sha256": "008b5fd80eb7e57ddceac3eac9bbf42a68c0439b83f03f8df986a0e4befac2b3", "ja": "…………。\nす、すみません。参考になりませんでしたか……。", "zh": "…………。\n对、对不起。没能帮上忙吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_6304_052kao", "source_sha256": "69ab3ec8242333897d817e14f28b0360c9675617997ad2ccd17e8e05f55feb16", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}さん！？　違うんです！\n今のは練習で……。これはやめた方がよさそうですね。", "zh": "咦，{$P$}先生！？不是这样的！\n刚才只是在练习……看来还是别这样比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
